        "# Root Directory Monitoring Implementation Tasks\r",
        "\r",
        "## Overview\r",
        "\r",
        "This document outlines the specific tasks needed to implement proper root directory monitoring in the MD-JSON synchronization system. The current limitation prevents Markdown files in the root directory from being properly synchronized with their JSON counterparts.\r",
        "\r",
        "## Prerequisites\r",
        "\r",
        "1. Install required dependencies:\r",
        "   ```bash\r",
        "   npm install chokidar fs-extra node-watch path moment\r",
        "   ```\r",
        "\r",
        "## Task List\r",
        "\r",
        "### Phase 1: Immediate Fix (1-2 hours)\r",
        "\r",
        "1. **Update Configuration**\r",
        "   - [ ] Add root directory to `watchDirs` in `config.json`:\r",
        "     ```javascript\r",
        "     {\r",
        "       \"watchDirs\": [\r",
        "         { \"md\": \"./\", \"json\": \"./json\" },\r",
        "         // existing entries...\r",
        "       ]\r",
        "     }\r",
        "     ```\r",
        "   - [ ] Add exclusion patterns for `node_modules`, `.git`, etc.\r",
        "\r",
        "2. **Test Basic Functionality**\r",
        "   - [ ] Create a test Markdown file in the root directory\r",
        "   - [ ] Start the sync system with the updated configuration\r",
        "   - [ ] Verify that changes to the root MD file are detected\r",
        "   - [ ] Verify JSON creation works for root files\r",
        "   - [ ] Verify JSON-to-MD synchronization works for root files\r",
        "\r",
        "### Phase 2: Alpha Agent Enhancement (2-3 hours)\r",
        "\r",
        "1. **Modify Root Directory Handling**\r",
        "   - [ ] Update `alpha-agent.js` to handle potential recursive watching conflicts\r",
        "   - [ ] Add special case for watching root directory files\r",
        "   - [ ] Implement improved path resolution for root files\r",
        "   - [ ] Add safeguards to prevent recursive events for the same file\r",
        "\r",
        "2. **Update File Path Resolution**\r",
        "   - [ ] Update `getCorrespondingJsonPath` to handle root directory files\r",
        "   - [ ] Update `getCorrespondingMdPath` to handle root directory files\r",
        "   - [ ] Ensure proper path normalization to prevent duplicate events\r",
        "\r",
        "3. **Test Enhanced Functionality**\r",
        "   - [ ] Verify directory overlapping doesn't cause duplicate events\r",
        "   - [ ] Check that recursive file changes are properly handled\r",
        "   - [ ] Validate performance impact of enhanced monitoring\r",
        "\r",
        "### Phase 3: Long-term Solution (3-4 hours)\r",
        "\r",
        "1. **Implement Recursive Workspace Monitoring**\r",
        "   - [ ] Refactor Alpha Agent to use chokidar's recursive watching\r",
        "   - [ ] Implement comprehensive exclusion patterns\r",
        "   - [ ] Add additional event debouncing for nested directories\r",
        "\r",
        "2. **Optimize Performance**\r",
        "   - [ ] Profile file watching performance\r",
        "   - [ ] Implement smarter file filtering\r",
        "   - [ ] Add configuration options for watch depth and patterns\r",
        "\r",
        "3. **Advanced Testing**\r",
        "   - [ ] Test with large directory structures\r",
        "   - [ ] Validate CPU and memory usage\r",
        "   - [ ] Verify behavior with various file system operations (rename, move, delete)\r",
        "\r",
        "## Verification Checklist\r",
        "\r",
        "After implementation, verify:\r",
        "\r",
        "- [ ] Root Markdown files are correctly synchronized to JSON\r",
        "- [ ] JSON changes properly propagate to root Markdown files\r",
        "- [ ] Nested directory synchronization works without conflicts\r",
        "- [ ] No duplicate events for the same file\r",
        "- [ ] No significant performance degradation\r",
        "- [ ] Backup and protection mechanisms still work correctly\r",
        "- [ ] No regression in existing functionality\r",
        "\r",
        "## Dependencies\r",
        "\r",
        "- Node.js module: chokidar (file watching)\r",
        "- Node.js module: fs-extra (enhanced file operations)\r",
        "- Node.js module: node-watch (fallback watcher)\r",
        "- Node.js module: path (path manipulation)\r",
        "- Node.js module: moment (timestamp formatting)\r",
        "\r",
        "## Documentation Updates\r",
        "\r",
        "After implementation, update:\r",
        "\r",
        "- [ ] README-md-json-sync.md to remove the limitation notice\r",
        "- [ ] memory.md to document the implementation\r",
        "- [ ] docs/implementation-status.md to mark root directory monitoring as complete\r",
        "- [ ] Update any configuration guides with new options\r",
        "\r",
        "## Future Improvements\r",
        "\r",
        "- Consider implementing a configuration UI for watch directories\r",
        "- Add performance metrics collection for optimizing file watching\r",
        "- Develop smart throttling based on file size and change frequency\r",
        "\r",
